{
  "name": "CF-06 HR Copilot (Plan → Approve → Execute)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## CF-06 · HR Copilot  `POST /webhook/cf/hr/copilot`  (HR token only)\n**Real planning for multi-step recruitment workflows** with a human in the loop:\n1. `mode: plan` → Planner LLM writes a JSON plan (steps, tools, consequential flags) → saved in `agent_plans` → returned to HR.\n2. HR reviews it in the dashboard → `mode: execute, plan_id` → plan is locked (`proposed → executing`, only by its author) → the Copilot agent runs it with tools.\n3. `mode: chat` → direct questions without a plan.\n\nEvery request, plan approval and execution is written to the audit log.",
        "height": 330,
        "width": 900,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "045d4239-b416-4f88-9840-664aebe7a4ed",
      "name": "Sticky Note 1",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
